@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### List users (synthetic demo identifiers)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### List transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions

### Find a transaction
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/txn-1001

### Missing transaction
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transactions/not-found

### Mock login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo-user",
  "password": "demo-password"
}
